# Project Chimera - Cursor Rules

## Context
This is Project Chimera, an autonomous AI influencer system using:
- FastRender Swarm Architecture (Planner-Worker-Judge)
- Model Context Protocol (MCP) for external interactions
- Coinbase AgentKit for financial transactions

## Rules

1. Always check specs/ before generating implementation code
2. Follow TDD: write failing tests first
3. Use Pydantic v2 for all data models
4. All external calls must go through MCP Tools
5. Type hints are mandatory
6. Async-first patterns preferred

## File References
- specs/_meta.md: Vision and constraints
- specs/functional.md: User stories
- specs/technical.md: API contracts
